  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "dsh-ufo",
      "text": "[English](README.en.md) · **简体中文**\n\n> 你太习惯这个世界了，才会对任何事情都不感到惊奇，慢慢失去了对世界与生俱来的好奇心。"
    },
    {
      "section": "怎么用",
      "text": "**① 网页版**\n\n插件 → 添加插件 → 粘贴 `https://github.com/HYClub/dsh-ufo` → 安装 → 重启 `dsh web`。\n\n```bash\ndsh plugin --profile web add https://github.com/HYClub/dsh-ufo\n```\n\n**② 桌面版**\n\n打开桌面客户端，插件 → 添加插件 → 填同一个 URL → 安装 → 重启客户端。\n\n> [!TIP]\n> **新开会话，输入 `/ufo` 进入档案终端。**\n\n> 具体内容需要你亲自探索。"
    },
    {
      "section": "数据来源",
      "text": "- **官方**：蓝皮书（Internet Archive）、GEIPAN（法）、英国国家档案馆、NARA RG 615、澳洲 A9755、新西兰 AIR。\n- **民间**：NUFORC 公开数据集镜像，约 8 万条。\n- **参考**：维基百科目击年表、Wikidata 事件锚点。\n- 还有些资料存放在我们到不了的地方。"
    },
    {
      "section": "dsh-ufo",
      "text": "**English** · [简体中文](README.md)\n\n> You've grown too used to this world — nothing surprises you anymore, and the curiosity you were born with quietly fades."
    },
    {
      "section": "How to use",
      "text": "**① Web client**\n\nPlugins → Add plugin → paste `https://github.com/HYClub/dsh-ufo` → Install → restart `dsh web`.\n\n```bash\ndsh plugin --profile web add https://github.com/HYClub/dsh-ufo\n```\n\n**② Desktop client**\n\nOpen the desktop app, then Plugins → Add plugin → paste the same URL → Install → restart the app.\n\n> [!TIP]\n> **In a new session, type `/ufo` to enter the archive terminal.**\n\n> The rest is yours to explore."
    },
    {
      "section": "Sources",
      "text": "- **Official**: Blue Book (Internet Archive), GEIPAN (France), The National Archives (UK), NARA RG 615, Australia's A9755, New Zealand's AIR.\n- **Civilian**: NUFORC public dataset mirror, around 80,000 reports.\n- **Reference**: Wikipedia sightings timeline, Wikidata event anchors.\n- Some records sit where we can't reach them."
    }
  ],
